39
00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.660
For intuition, the deck describes

40
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.860
pairing equal-rank elements of two

41
00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.260
arrays by using sorting. Sort

42
00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.300
X equal to three, one,

43
00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.640
two and Y equal to

44
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.100
