45
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.500
one with ten, two with

46
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.140
twenty, and three with thirty.

47
00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.920
That pairing example illustrates using

48
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.600
