49
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.700
task, but a formal decision

50
00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.960
reduction needs the yes-if-and-only-if statement.

51
00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:42.360
Likewise, repeatedly calling a factor-finding

52
00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.460
