55
00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.360
To show a new problem

56
00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.400
B is hard, start from

57
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.300
a problem A already known

58
00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.220
hard and transform A into

59
00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.720
B. Then a hypothetical fast

60
00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.080
B solver would give a

61
00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.500
fast A solver, transferring the

62
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.220
