63
00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.760
Reducing B to a known-hard

64
00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.120
A goes the wrong way

65
00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.440
for that argument. Easy problems

66
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.940
