70
00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.540
A complete proof states the

71
00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.940
construction, its runtime, and both

72
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.500
directions of correctness. Showing one

73
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.860
transformed example works demonstrates the

74
00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.960
